      "term": "Plutocracy",
      "aliases": [
        "plutocrat",
        "plutocrats",
        "plutocratic"
      ],
      "short": "Rule by the rich. A plutocrat is someone whose wealth gives them power.",
      "seeAlso": [
        "ultraliberalism"
      ]
    },
    {
